{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COLLAPSUS\u2122 is a one-of-a-kind block-crunching puzzle game all about gravity manipulation and resource management!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Leon the Chameleon as you twist, tilt, turn, &amp; flip your device as you solve your way through endless, mind-bending puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >          <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/ac9f99672bdd2e75bfa8ce07ec36771c.poster.avif?t=1770159053\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/ac9f99672bdd2e75bfa8ce07ec36771c.webm?t=1770159053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/ac9f99672bdd2e75bfa8ce07ec36771c.mp4?t=1770159053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >===============</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/7e6d838adf4fdeb464f9094725fec7b8.webp?t=1770159053\" width=16 height=16 /></span> 3 Standard difficulties + 2 Unlockable difficulties; each with Zen Mode, Gravity Rush, and Time Panic variations for endless gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/967f3f2405fa1fdc6c34869fdff7a7e9.webp?t=1770159053\" width=16 height=16 /></span> 30 mind-bending Challenge Modes + 30 &quot;Plus&quot; Modes that add wild new mechanics to the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/90031b960cb9d6c2635e501306e1be35.webp?t=1770159053\" width=16 height=16 /></span> Mission Mode with 50 objective-based puzzle ops and 50 &quot;Secret Missions&quot; to amp up the challenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/8037e7bbe2cc7966ec57828c8c683df3.webp?t=1770159053\" width=16 height=16 /></span> Puzzle Mode with 300 puzzles, free Daily Puzzles, and online Puzzle Maker to test your wits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/beb498f5163611c9f5fcfad9ef0b79f7.webp?t=1770159053\" width=16 height=16 /></span> Multiplayer Battle Mode, where up to 8 players can fight it out for dominance online or locally</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/4c7953fae85ab5797ed16c9f31184ba3.webp?t=1770159053\" width=16 height=16 /></span> Over 50 accessibility options so everyone can play (including color-blind palettes, dyslexia-friendly font options, remappable controls, and more)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Best part? No Ads. No microtransactions. No loot boxes. Free DLC for life!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/fa9417322cdff286aaf83de86719d573.poster.avif?t=1770159053\" width=276 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/fa9417322cdff286aaf83de86719d573.webm?t=1770159053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/fa9417322cdff286aaf83de86719d573.mp4?t=1770159053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BREAK BLOCKS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on individual blocks to break them forever. When you do, the blocks above will fall to take that space.[/td]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/88927672228748de157c37b7455edf19.poster.avif?t=1770159053\" width=366 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/88927672228748de157c37b7455edf19.webm?t=1770159053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/88927672228748de157c37b7455edf19.mp4?t=1770159053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MANAGE RESOURCES!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every click, you lose a resource called &quot;Breaks&quot;. Lose all ten of them and it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/bfcf8d5c8785ee2325a1d03bab4a02c4.poster.avif?t=1770159053\" width=342 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/bfcf8d5c8785ee2325a1d03bab4a02c4.webm?t=1770159053\" type=\"video/webm; c